+ * Defaults are the values measured optimal on the STM32H7 + WiFi-DAP
+ * USBIP/USB-NCM pipeline (2026-10-21): pending depth 4 (= upstream depth,
+ * deeper values do not help this firmware and depth 8 + eager reads is 26%
+ * slower for 1 MiB reads) and eager response reads enabled (hides one network
