+/* Up to MIN(packet_count, max_pending_requests) requests may be issued
+ * until the first response arrives.
+ *
+ * MAX_PENDING_REQUESTS is the compile-time capacity, not the effective depth:
+ * the depth is runtime tunable via the 'cmsis-dap pending_requests' config
